        <div class="card-grid card-grid-4">
          <article class="panel info-card">
            <span class="card-index">01</span>
            <h3>Image Data</h3>
            <p>Synchronized multi-view images from four cameras for perception and scene understanding.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="panel info-card">
            <span class="card-index">02</span>
            <h3>GNSS / IMU Trajectories</h3>
            <p>High-precision vehicle trajectories for motion analysis and planning evaluation.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="panel info-card">
            <span class="card-index">03</span>
            <h3>Raw Video Data</h3>
            <p>Continuous multi-camera recordings exist internally, but are not included in the current public release.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="panel info-card">
            <span class="card-index">04</span>
            <h3>Scenario Labels</h3>
            <p>Structured attributes describe road type, traffic conditions, lighting, and environmental context.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
